I leave the house with my big umbrella.
It is raining very heavily today.
I wait for the BEST bus at the bus stop.
After a few minutes, my bus arrives and I climb inside.
I sit near the window and look outside.
The conductor comes to give me a ticket.
I say to him, "Bhaiya, give me one ticket."
He gives me the ticket.
I say to him, "It rained very heavily yesterday."
"But today the water has completely flooded the roads."
The conductor says, "Yes madam, the water has risen a lot today."
"The traffic has also become quite slow."
I look at the waterlogged roads outside through the window.
Cars are moving very slowly through the water.
Children are playing in the water.
People are walking slowly with umbrellas.
The bus is also moving very slowly today.
Even so, I am not running late.
But reaching the office today is not easy.
